/S /P
/E (We commenced our analysis by examining the distribution and skewness of the target variable, Yield \(YA\), employing various visual inspection techniques. To evaluate the overall shape of the distribution, we utilized a histogram alongside a kernel density estimate \(KDE\) plot. This combination allowed us to visualize the frequency of yield values and identify any underlying patterns. Additionally, we calculated the numerical skewness coefficient to quantify the degree of asymmetry in the distribution. This coefficient is crucial for understanding whether the yield data is symmetrically distributed or if it exhibits skewness, which could influence the performance of our predictive models.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [5]
>>
