2055 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (  These parameters include the type of objective function \(reg:squarederror\) which is appropriate for regression tasks, as well as the random state for reproducibility. The tree_method is set to 'hist' to optimize performance for larger datasets. Key hyperparameters like the number of trees \(n_estimators\), the depth of each tree \(max_depth\), and the learning rate \(learning_rate\) are critical for tuning the model's complexity and convergence speed. These parameters are fine-tuned using a randomized search approach to ensure optimal model performance.)
/Pg 108 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
