<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (         DURING THIS CHAPTER, WE WILL FIRST BEGIN BY PRESENTING THE TOOLS AND TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED TO SUCCESSFULLY ACCOMPLISH OUR MISSION WITHIN THE FARMWISE PLATFORM. WE WILL ALSO EXPLORE THE TECHNICAL ENVIRONMENTS ON WHICH WE RELIED TO DEVELOP OUR APPLICATION, ENSURING A ROBUST AND TAILORED INFRASTRUCTURE TO MEET THE NEEDS OF TUNISIAN FARMERS. SUBSEQUENTLY, WE WILL EXAMINE THE CHOSEN ARCHITECTURE, DESIGNED TO OPTIMIZE THE INTEGRATION OF ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE MODELS, BEFORE CONCLUDING WITH THE IMPLEMENTATION PHASE, ILLUSTRATED BY SCREENSHOTS OF THE FINAL RENDER OF OUR PLATFORM, SHOWCASING ITS INTUITIVE AND FUNCTIONAL USER INTERFACE.)
/Pg 129 0 R
/K [1]
