/E (    KERAS, A HIGH-LEVEL API BUILT ON TOP OF TENSORFLOW, WAS UTILIZED TO STREAMLINE THE DEVELOPMENT OF DEEP LEARNING MODELS FOR THE FARMWISE PLATFORM. IT SIMPLIFIED THE IMPLEMENTATION OF THE XCEPTION MODEL BY PROVIDING AN INTUITIVE INTERFACE FOR DEFINING NEURAL NETWORK ARCHITECTURES, CONFIGURING LAYERS, AND MANAGING TRAINING PROCESSES. KERAS WAS PARTICULARLY USEFUL FOR RAPID PROTOTYPING OF THE PLANT DISEASE DETECTION AND VOLUNTEER PLANT CLASSIFICATION MODELS, ALLOWING US TO EXPERIMENT WITH DIFFERENT CONFIGURATIONS IN GOOGLE COLAB BEFORE FINALIZING THE MODELS. ITS SEAMLESS INTEGRATION WITH TENSORFLOW ENSURED EFFICIENT DEPLOYMENT OF THESE MODELS INTO THE DJANGO BACKEND, ENABLING THE "DISEASE" AND "VOLUNTARY" INTERFACES TO DELIVER ACCURATE AND USER-FRIENDLY PREDICTIONS TO FARMERS.)
/Pg 131 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
