2400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (    THE DATA STORAGE & PROCESSING LAYER ENSURES EFFICIENT MANAGEMENT AND PREPARATION OF DATA FOR DOWNSTREAM ANALYSIS AND MODELING. STORAGE IS BIFURCATED INTO TWO COMPONENTS: RAW CSV FILES AND IMAGES ARE INITIALLY STORED LOCALLY DURING DEVELOPMENT AND LATER MIGRATED TO CLOUD STORAGE SOLUTIONS LIKE GOOGLE DRIVE OR AMAZON S3 FOR SCALABILITY AND ACCESSIBILITY DURING PRODUCTION. CLEANED AND PROCESSED DATASETS ARE STORED IN RELATIONAL DATABASES, WITH POSTGRESQL USED IN PRODUCTION FOR ITS ROBUSTNESS AND SQLITE EMPLOYED DURING DEVELOPMENT FOR SIMPLICITY. PROCESSING INVOLVES DATA CLEANING, TRANSFORMATION, AND FEATURE ENGINEERING TO PREPARE DATASETS FOR MACHINE LEARNING MODELS. PYTHON LIBRARIES SUCH AS PANDAS ARE USED FOR DATA WRANGLING TASKS \(E.G., HANDLING MISSING VALUES, NORMALIZING SOIL NUTRIENT LEVELS\), WHILE SCIKIT-LEARN)
/Pg 135 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
